- dsh-quote-annotate
  https://github.com/wangwei-wade/dsh-quote-annotate
  MIT License — Copyright (c) 2026 wangwei-wade

  The BASE chat-message quoting flow (selection → annotate → quote block
  serialization, including the `> ` block format and the 「引用#N」 chip
  pipeline) derives from this project.

  The following are ORIGINAL additions of dsh-file-quote:
    - Sidebar file quoting: quoting the detailed content of files previewed
      in the sidebar, with the file path and exact line range embedded in
      the quote block, for every file type the sidebar can preview or edit.
    - Persistent collapse in BOTH the composer and the sent conversation
      history (the quote block stays collapsed on the user side while the
      AI still receives the full text and source).
    - Click-to-jump-back: locating and highlighting the quoted position in
      the file (editor locate + highlight, message-row scroll + flash, or a
      file-source overlay fallback).
